  "short_summary": "Convertible promissory note for $500,000 issued by HealthRate, Inc. to First Trust Capital Partners, LLC on August 30, 2024.",
  "long_summary": "This document is a convertible promissory note where HealthRate, Inc., a Nevada corporation, promises to pay First Trust Capital Partners, LLC $500,000 with 10% annual interest, due on August 30, -2026. The note can convert into preferred stock under specified conditions, including a qualified financing of at least $3,000,000, with conversion price based on the lesser of 80% of the financing price or $7,000,000 divided by fully diluted capitalization. It includes terms for liquidity events, defaults, and legal provisions governed by Delaware law with venue in Illinois.",
